
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000

### جلب كل المصروفات
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses

### جلب مصروف واحد
GET {{baseUrl}}/expenses/2

### إضافة مصروف
POST {{baseUrl}}/expenses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "amount": 75,
  "categoryId": 1,
  "description": "Transport",
  "date": "2026-10-09"
}

### حذف مصروف
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/expenses/2
